---

<ServiceLayout
  lang={lang}
  title="Promotional items & print | SEZMOO"
  description="Catalogues, folders, decks, POS and merchandise by SEZMOO – print and digital sales tools consistent with your brand identity. Gdańsk, Poland."
  canonical={canonical}
  jsonLd={jsonLd}
>
<div class="sd">
<section class="sd__hero shell">
  <span class="sd__kick reveal"><i></i>Services</span>
  <h1 class="sd__h1 reveal">Promotional <span style="color:#ffd200">material.</span></h1>
  <p class="sd__lead reveal" data-d="1">A catalogue, folder or deck is often <b>the last thing before a decision</b> – so we treat them as sales tools, not decoration.</p>
  <p class="sd__lead reveal" data-d="1">We design print and digital material: catalogues, folders, leaflets, decks, POS material and merchandise – consistent with the brand identity.</p>
  <div class="sd__facts reveal" data-d="2">
    <div class="sd__fact"><span>Scope</span><strong>Print · POS · decks</strong></div>
    <div class="sd__fact"><span>Hierarchy</span><strong>Content leads to a decision</strong></div>
    <div class="sd__fact"><span>Files</span><strong>Print-ready</strong></div>
    <div class="sd__fact"><span>Adaptation</span><strong>Digital versions</strong></div>
  </div>
  <figure class="sd__reel reveal" data-d="1">
    <img src="/assets/optimized/lcp/audi-kartka-e83a2084-1920.webp" srcset="/assets/optimized/lcp/audi-kartka-e83a2084-800.webp 800w, /assets/optimized/lcp/audi-kartka-e83a2084-1280.webp 1280w, /assets/optimized/lcp/audi-kartka-e83a2084-1920.webp 1920w" sizes="100vw" width="1920" height="1920" alt="Audi" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" />
    <figcaption><b>Audi</b><span>Premium print / sales material</span></figcaption>
  </figure>
</section>
<div class="sd__body shell">
  <div>
    <section class="sd__blk" id="sd-zakres">
      <div class="sd__blkh reveal"><h2>What we do</h2></div>
      <details class="sd__g reveal" open><summary><h3>Catalogues &amp; folders</h3><span class="sd__pm"></span></summary><div class="sd__gin"><p>Information and sales material with clear content hierarchy – from a one-page leaflet to a full product catalogue.</p><div class="sd__tags"><span>Product catalogue</span><span>Advertising folder</span><span>Leaflet</span><span>Brochure</span><span>Price list</span><span>Product sheet</span></div></div></details>
      <details class="sd__g reveal" open><summary><h3>Decks &amp; offers</h3><span class="sd__pm"></span></summary><div class="sd__gin"><p>Sales decks, offer presentations and partner decks – documents that sell without a rep in the room.</p><div class="sd__tags"><span>Sales deck</span><span>Offer deck</span><span>Partner deck</span><span>Deck template</span><span>Report and summary</span><span>One-pager</span></div></div></details>
      <details class="sd__g reveal"><summary><h3>POS &amp; events</h3><span class="sd__pm"></span></summary><div class="sd__gin"><p>Display material for the point of sale and for events: stands, walls, roll-ups and booth signage.</p><div class="sd__tags"><span>Stands and displays</span><span>Roll-up</span><span>Event wall</span><span>Booth signage</span><span>Trade fair material</span><span>Stickers and windows</span></div></div></details>
      <details class="sd__g reveal"><summary><h3>Merchandise &amp; gifts</h3><span class="sd__pm"></span></summary><div class="sd__gin"><p>Branded clothing and gifts with a logo – chosen so someone actually wants to use them.</p><div class="sd__tags"><span>Branded clothing</span><span>Branded merchandise</span><span>Welcome kits</span><span>Client gifts</span><span>Conference material</span><span>Packaging</span></div></div></details>
    </section>
    <section class="sd__blk" id="sd-proces">
      <div class="sd__blkh reveal"><h2>How we work</h2></div>
      <div class="sd__steps">
        <div class="sd__step reveal"><h3>Scope</h3><p>We settle who the material should help decide.</p></div>
        <div class="sd__step reveal"><h3>Content</h3><p>We order the information and the arguments.</p></div>
        <div class="sd__step reveal"><h3>Design</h3><p>Layout, type and imagery in the brand's style.</p></div>
        <div class="sd__step reveal"><h3>Preparation</h3><p>Bleeds, colour and files for the chosen technique.</p></div>
        <div class="sd__step reveal"><h3>Print</h3><p>Production oversight and digital versions.</p></div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="sd__blk" id="sd-work">
      <div class="sd__blkh reveal"><h2>Selected work</h2></div>
      <div class="sd__work">
        <a class="sd__wi reveal" href="/en/realizacja-kapka/"><div class="sd__wm"><img src="/assets/portfolio/kapka/kapka-menu.jpg" alt="Kapka Cafe – Menu · Print" loading="lazy" /></div><span>Menu · Print</span><h3>Kapka Cafe ↗</h3></a>
        <a class="sd__wi reveal" href="/en/portfolio-en/?cat=grafika#pt-grid"><div class="sd__wm"><img src="/assets/portfolio/spenner/marcin-spenner-projekt-okladki-plyty-01.avif" alt="Marcin Spenner – Album cover · Design" loading="lazy" /></div><span>Album cover · Design</span><h3>Marcin Spenner ↗</h3></a>
        <a class="sd__wi reveal" href="/realizacja-world-of-warships/"><div class="sd__wm"><img src="/assets/work/captains-club-1.avif" alt="World of Warships – Material · Event" loading="lazy" /></div><span>Material · Event</span><h3>World of Warships ↗</h3></a>
      </div>
      <div class="sd__more reveal">
        <a class="is-lead" href="/en/portfolio-en/#pt-grid">Full portfolio ↗</a>
        <a href="/en/portfolio-en/?cat=video#pt-grid">Video</a>
        <a href="/en/portfolio-en/?cat=animacje#pt-grid">Animation</a>
        <a href="/en/portfolio-en/?cat=eventy#pt-grid">Events</a>
        <a href="/en/portfolio-en/?cat=grafika#pt-grid">Graphics</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</div>
</div>
</ServiceLayout>
